{"title": "Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)", "pageid": 45138, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tu'narath's_Embrace_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tu'narath's Embrace Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Tu'narath's Embrace</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This creature was blessed by a nearby Ch'r'ai, it cannot be affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">incapacitating conditions</a> and received <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"50 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_GITHYANKIPALADIN_VLAAKITHCRY</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_GITHYANKIPALADIN_VLAAKITHCRY%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_GITHYANKIPALADIN_VLAAKITHCRY%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The immunity to incapacitating conditions extends to everything in the <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitated</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Stunned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Stunned\">Stunned</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Fleeing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Fleeing\">Fleeing</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Restrained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Restrained\">Restrained</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">Prone</a> status groups.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Tu.27narath.27s_Embrace\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Tu'narath's_Embrace\">Sources of Tu'narath's Embrace</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/45px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/60px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/image